Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

 Global keys
  1-5                  Sessions; Graph; Quotas; Messages; Tools
  c                    open the CTO session
  C                    focus the CTO box for its own keys: enter opens the full
                       CTO, ctrl+] returns, esc skips a tip
  tab                  move to the next field; back to Sessions
  ?                    help
  /                    filter; find a node; enter selects the first match and
                       esc cancels
  esc                  back; clear or back; Graph; clear
  R                    refresh; rescan
  q, ctrl+c            quit
  enter                go into the selected session in herdr (ctrl+] returns on
                       fallback), or run the selected row's action; detail; open
                       the selected message body; open the selected agent card;
                       select the first match; open Sessions filtered to this
                       agent's project; open the difference plan; open the item
                       details and actions
  up/down, j/k         move the selection; select a conversation; select a
                       subscription; move the selection between nodes; move
  more below
up/down scroll  esc close help  q quit
